  "description": "Ji Eun-Soo was unilaterally divorced by her husband Yu Tae-Han three years ago.\nShe believed she was over it—no longer caring who he dated or remarried.\n\nThat is, until she finds out he's planning to marry Yu Jeong-Ha—the very woman she spent her whole life envying.\n\nDriven by anger and desperation, Ji Eun-Soo decides to sabotage the wedding by spending a night with her ex-husband.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4690000392), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13109925), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/feeey38), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/another_tonight), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000072372), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260043)",
